This is a pretty simple three-round boxing game that I modified from
an old book called BASIC COMPUTER GAMES. The original coding was done by
Jesse Lynch.

Just pop this baby into it's own door directory per instructions in the
Metro docs.

Once again I'd like to thank Percy Broadnax for writing a great BBS program.
AND I'd like to give a hearty FOO-2-U to all the people using the BBS who
haven't registered their copies. Come on guys! It ain't that much!

